title: R3_1
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Angry")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Attendant.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: You should really know what our emblem looks like.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: It’s literally on the cover of your tome. I noticed the difference immediately.
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: In the future, don’t bring me such apparent scams as I am already severely overworked
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R3_2
---
<<if change_person("Berg", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Hello there, attendant!
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Thanks for letting Gwen know about the order confirmation. 
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: She always forgets to do it in time, I was almost starting to think that she ignored my scrolls on purpose because I forgot to feed her dragon. 
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Now I see that she probably just wasn’t able to sort through the scrolls in time. 
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: There has been a huge improvement since you’ve started! 
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Say hi to little Rufus for me, will you?
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R3_3
---
<<if change_person("Gwen", "Happy")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: Thanks for giving me the scroll from Shoshanna so quickly!
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: I let her know I needed those spider silk parchments in a separate delivery, and wouldn’t you know, the delivery was on my desk this evening! 
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: She must have bypassed Brooms Express or something just to bring them to me in time.
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Gwendolen: She’s a saviour, and so are you!
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R3_4
---
<<if change_person("Bearmun", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Bearmun: Greetings, attendant.
<<trigger_talk>>
Bearmun: Arthur brought to my attention that you had noticed someone impersonating me. 
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Bearmun: I want to personally thank you and ensure you that this issue has been taken care of. 
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Bearmun: On a different note, you don’t have to avoid making eye contact with me. 
<<set_mood "Happy">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Bearmun: The rumours of me casting vanishing spells left and right is a cruel joke on new employees by my old friend Vincent Crysologus.
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Bearmun: Good evening and carry on with the good work.
<<end_of_response>>
===

title: R3_5
---
<<if change_person("Berg", "Neutral")>>//you need if for it to work :(
<<endif>>
<<wait_until_entered>>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Hi attendant, do you have time?
<<set_mood "Angry">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: Can you do me a huge favor and tell me if Gwen still is mad at me for forgetting to feed her dragon? 
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: She refuses to send replies for my scrolls. I really need her to sign off those orders or she will be the least of my problems.
<<set_mood "Neutral">>
<<trigger_talk>>
Berg: I almost forgot, do you know if Rufus got the treats I left at Gwen’s desk after the incident...? 
<<end_of_response>>
